    "Back 10 seconds on the TV": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "10 seconden terug op de tv"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Forward 10 seconds on the TV": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "10 seconden vooruit op de tv"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When you open the app, it sends a random number made for this app, your country and the hour. Not your name, your server or what you watch.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Als je de app opent, stuurt hij een willekeurig nummer dat alleen voor deze app is gemaakt, je land en het uur. Niet je naam, je server of wat je kijkt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The country comes from your internet address, which is never stored.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Het land komt uit je internetadres, en dat adres wordt nooit bewaard."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can change this any time in Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je kunt dit altijd wijzigen in Instellingen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Anonymous usage statistics": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Anonieme gebruiksstatistiek"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What is sent": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wat er wordt verstuurd"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Usage statistics": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gebruiksstatistiek"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Privacy": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Privacy"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Counts this device per country, so JellyCast can find advertisers and stay free.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Telt dit apparaat per land, zodat JellyCast adverteerders kan vinden en gratis blijft."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ad": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Advertentie"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Visit website": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Naar de website"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Why am I seeing this?": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Waarom zie ik dit?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "JellyCast chooses ads by country only, never by what you watch.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JellyCast kiest advertenties alleen op land, nooit op wat je kijkt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "JellyCast chooses ads by country only, never by what you watch. You see this one because you're in %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JellyCast kiest advertenties alleen op land, nooit op wat je kijkt. Je ziet deze omdat je in %@ bent."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For support it also sends the kind of device, its system version and the app version, such as \"iPhone 17, iOS 26, JellyCast 1.0\". Not the name of your device.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voor ondersteuning stuurt hij ook het soort toestel, de systeemversie en de app-versie mee, zoals \"iPhone 17, iOS 26, JellyCast 1.0\". Niet de naam van je toestel."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "More information": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Meer informatie"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Continue without statistics": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verder zonder statistiek"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Statistics": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Statistiek"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The details are deleted after 13 months.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "De gegevens worden na 13 maanden verwijderd."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We count how many devices use JellyCast, per country, to keep it free. Without your name or what you watch.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "We tellen hoeveel toestellen JellyCast gebruiken, per land, om de app gratis te houden. Zonder je naam of wat je kijkt."
          }
        }
      }
    }
